OL,3,AThird runway at Heathrow Airport would
OL,4,Adrive growth, Healey says
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has said
OL,7,Fbuilding a third runway at Heathrow
OL,8,FAirport would boost economic growth.
OL,10,FSpeaking from the International
OL,11,FMonetary Fund (IMF) meetings in
OL,12,FBangkok, Healey said that airport
OL,13,Fexpansion, including at Heathrow, had
OL,14,Fbeen "a big part of jobs and growth" in
OL,15,Frecent decades.
OL,17,FHis predecessor Rachel Reeves had put
OL,18,FHeathrow expansion at the centrepiece
OL,19,Fof an argument that Britain is open for
OL,20,Fbusiness.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
